# sapintegrationsuite_integration_assessment_key_characteristic_value (Data Source)

Returns the Id and description of one value of a key characteristic of SAP's Integration Solution
Advisory Methodology, to rate a technology on it with
[`sapintegrationsuite_integration_assessment_technology_key_characteristic`](../resources/integration_assessment_technology_key_characteristic.md).
The same value name can belong to several key characteristics, so the lookup takes the key
characteristic's name as well.

**Status:** unofficial. Needs `enable_unofficial = true` in the provider block. SAP documents the
Integration Assessment Entities API and this entity, but the field-level specification on the
Business Accelerator Hub needs an SAP login. The requests follow the service's `$metadata` and
were verified on a tenant in September 2026; SAP may change them without notice.

Both names are compared exactly, including case. The plan fails unless exactly one key
characteristic has the given name and exactly one of its values has the value name.

